<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Sieve</span>: Sample-Efficient Parametric Learning from Natural Language</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Parth Asawa
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
