<span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
<span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Generate a realistic question where the following feedback/guidelines/knowledge would apply:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{selected feedback}
