<span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instructions:
<br class="ltx_break">1. Create a specific question where the information applies, similar to the format of the examples below
<br class="ltx_break">2. Make it realistic
<br class="ltx_break">3. Include all necessary details
<br class="ltx_break">4. Output ONLY the question, nothing else
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
